  "description": "Takes a punishment and keeps coming back for more! The ARKTOS enduro setup devours even the most brutal trails with speed, confidence and dependability... but climbs unlike any big travel bike you've ridden.\n\nRowdy, enduro race machine.\n\n170mm front, 150mm rear\n\nAlchemy Premium Carbon Fiber\n\nFox Factory Suspension and Dropper\n\nIndustry Nine wheels and hubs\n\nMullet wheel compatible\n\nWhy the Arktos 150?\n\nLike to get ROWDY when you ride? Is it all about high-speed thrills? Is bigger always better? If you answered “yes” to any of these, the Arktos 150 is definitely the bike for you. This bike takes its punishment and keeps coming back for more. With a 170mm FOX Factory 38 front suspension and 150mm rear, complemented by our patented Sine Suspension, it devours even the most brutal trails with speed, confidence and dependability. Like you, the 150 is happiest when you’re absolutely sending it! But don’t let those numbers fool you – despite its descending pedigree, the 150 will also get you to the top with surprising swiftness and agility.\n\nBonus: Arktos 135 and 150 models are also available in a ‘mullet’ setup, with a 29” front wheel and 27.5” rear which is gaining traction quickly in MTB, and has been used for years in motocross. The larger front hoop flows over big hits, while the smaller rear wheel provides quicker acceleration.\n\nOne Arktos to RIDE Them All:\nConversion Kits: Quickly transform your 150 into a 135 or even a 120 (and back again) with Alchemy’s conversion kits: Get two (or three) bikes in one – for a fraction of the cost of buying a second bike – and always have the ideal rig for your immediate riding plans. Kits include corresponding shock and fork.",
